OL,3,GNEWSA'Dehydrated underweight' seal pup
OL,4,Arescued from beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "badly dehydrated, underweight and
OL,7,Fabandoned" baby seal has been rescued
OL,8,Ffrom a Lancashire beach.
OL,10,FIt was found stranded on Fleetwood
OL,11,Fbeach on Saturday morning, the
OL,12,Fcoastguard said.
OL,14,FThe person who found the pup "did
OL,15,Fabsolutely the right thing" by
OL,16,Fcontacting the British Divers Marine
OL,17,FLife Rescue (BDMLR), a charity that
OL,18,Fresponds to stranded, injured or
OL,19,Ftrapped marine animals, the coastguard
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
